JAWAB:

RE (Regulated Entity) DLG ko sirf neeche diye gaye forms me accept kar sakta hai:

a. RE ke paas jama ki gayi cash [RBI/2025-26/36::22], [RBI/2023-24/41::5];
b. Scheduled Commercial Bank me rakhi gayi Fixed Deposit, jis par RE ke favour me lien mark ho [RBI/2025-26/36::22], [RBI/2023-24/41::5];
c. RE ke favour me Bank Guarantee [RBI/2025-26/36::22], [RBI/2023-24/41::5].
